{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0206","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000011b:text","row":29581,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"美希と霧がいた。","en":"Miki and Kiri are there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800402","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00001","en":"Miki and Kiri were there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000014b:text","row":29582,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「……食い物ありませんか？」","en":"“...Got anything to eat?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800403","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00002","en":"Taichi: \"...without any food, are you?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese asks whether any food is available; the English changes it into a malformed negative tag question.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":39,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"...without any food, are you?\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000205:text","row":29583,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「残念ながら」","en":"“Afraid not.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800404","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00003","en":"Miki: \"Unfortunately...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000233:text","row":29584,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「その弁当……？」","en":"“What about that lunchbox...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800405","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00004","en":"Taichi: \"And that bento...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000025d:text","row":29585,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"ライス。","en":"Rice.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800406","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00005","en":"Rice.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000027d:text","row":29586,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"ミートボール。","en":"Meatballs.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800407","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00006","en":"Meatballs.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000002ab:text","row":29587,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「お、おい、なぜそのようなものが……？」","en":"“H-how did you get food like that...?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800408","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00007","en":"Taichi: \"H-, hey, why do you have that...?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000371:text","row":29588,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちんが作ったのですよ。飯ごうとかで」","en":"“Kiri-kins made it. In a camping pot and everything.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800409","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00008","en":"Miki: \"Kiri-chin made it! With camping utensils.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000003b9:text","row":29589,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわ、いいなあ」","en":"“Oh man, I'm jealous.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800410","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00009","en":"Taichi: \"Whoa, nice innit.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000004bd:text","row":29590,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「……先輩の分はありません」","en":"“...There's none for you.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800411","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00010","en":"Kiri: \"...there is no part of it for Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000552:text","row":29591,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"きっぱり。","en":"No hesitation.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800412","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00011","en":"Plainly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000057c:text","row":29592,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「かなり分量があるじゃないか」","en":"“But there's plenty.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800413","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Isn't there a fair amount?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000638:text","row":29593,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「多いですよね」","en":"“There is, isn’t there?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800414","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00013","en":"Miki: \"There's a lot indeed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000660:text","row":29594,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"明らかに三人分はありそうだ。","en":"It looks like enough for three.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800415","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00014","en":"It's obvious this could be enough for three people.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000006b7:text","row":29595,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「しかしなぜか先輩のはないんです」","en":"“And yet, for some reason, none of it is yours.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800416","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00015","en":"Kiri: \"However for some reason there is none for Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000006f9:text","row":29596,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「……むぅ」","en":"“...Hmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800417","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00016","en":"Taichi: \"...mngh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000071d:text","row":29597,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"イノセンスが唸る。","en":"My innocence growls.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800418","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00017","en":"So growls Innocence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000074f:text","row":29598,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃー物々交換しよう」","en":"“Then let's barter.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800419","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Theeen let's transact bit of a barter.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000805:text","row":29599,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「トレードですな」","en":"“A trade, then.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800420","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00019","en":"Miki: \"A trade you mean.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000837:text","row":29600,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「あめ玉とグミキャンディー。手作り」","en":"“Hard candy and gummies. Homemade.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800421","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Hard candy and gummy candy. Handmade.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000092a:text","row":29601,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"二人の目の色が変わった。","en":"Their eyes light up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800422","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00021","en":"The eyes of the two opened very wide.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000097f:text","row":29602,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「てづくり？」","en":"“Homemade?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800423","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00022","en":"Miki: \"Made by hand?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000009ad:text","row":29603,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「んー。曜子ちゃんがだけど」","en":"“Well, Youko made them.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800424","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Mh-hm. By Youko-chan though.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000009e9:text","row":29604,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「シュガー控えめ、美容健康にいいらしい。グミはこんにゃくだね。０カロリー」","en":"“Low in sugar, and apparently good for your looks and your health. The gummies are made from konjac. Zero calories.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800425","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00024","en":"Taichi: \"Sugar in moderation may be good for maintaining an attractive body shape. Gummies are Konjac, 'course. 0 calories.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000b27:text","row":29605,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「０カロリー！？」","en":"“ZERO CALORIES?!”","speakerJa":"二人","speakerEn":"Both","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800426","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00025","en":"Both: \"0 CALORIES?!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000cb6:text","row":29606,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"……………………。","en":"...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800427","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00026","en":"............","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000ce8:text","row":29607,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「わーい」","en":"“Yay.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800428","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00027","en":"Taichi: \"Weeee.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000d0a:text","row":29608,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"交換成立。","en":"Deal.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800429","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00028","en":"Barter concluded.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000e08:text","row":29609,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「ママの味がする……」","en":"“Tastes just like Mom used to make...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800430","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00029","en":"Miki: \"It's like your mommy used to make...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000e59:text","row":29610,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「するね」","en":"“It really does.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800431","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00030","en":"Kiri: \"Just like.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000ea0:text","row":29611,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「ミルクだね」","en":"“Must be the milk.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800432","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00031","en":"Miki: \"Milky isn't it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000ee9:text","row":29612,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「だねー」","en":"“Yeah.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800433","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00032","en":"Kiri: \"Isn't it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000f13:text","row":29613,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「ストーカーの味だけどね」","en":"“Though technically, it’s stalker-flavored.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800434","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Tastes like stalker though.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000f6a:text","row":29614,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ほっぺが……わらひのほっぺが……」","en":"“My cheeks... my cheeksh...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800435","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00034","en":"Miki: \"My cheeks... my schmiling cheeks...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000fc9:text","row":29615,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん～～～っ」","en":"“Mmmmm!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800436","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00035","en":"Kiri: \"Mhhh～～～!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00000fef:text","row":29616,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"女の子だなあ。","en":"Girls, huh?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800437","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00036","en":"Girls.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001015:text","row":29617,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"おかげでライスにありつけた。","en":"And just like that, I get some rice.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800438","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00037","en":"And thanks to that, I have come into rice.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001049:text","row":29618,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"やっぱ日本人だから。","en":"I'm Japanese, after all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800439","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00038","en":"Because I'm Japanese, after all.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000107d:text","row":29619,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「うまい……霧ちんは料理の才能がある」","en":"“This is good... You've got a real talent for cooking, Kiri-kins.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800440","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00039","en":"Taichi: \"Delicious... you got talent for cooking, Kiri-chin.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001195:text","row":29620,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「……おかずはレトルトなんで」","en":"“...The meatballs are prepackaged.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800441","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00040","en":"Kiri: \"...side dishes are retort pouch however.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000011d3:text","row":29621,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「でもうまい」","en":"“Still good.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800442","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00041","en":"Taichi: \"Still delicious.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000127d:text","row":29622,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「作らないと、美希がいつまでもお菓子を」","en":"“If I don't cook for her, Miki will go on eating candy forever.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800443","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00042","en":"Kiri: \"If I didn't make anything, Miki would only ever eat junk food.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001343:text","row":29623,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「お菓子好きだもん」","en":"“I like candy.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800444","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00043","en":"Miki: \"But I love junk food.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001377:text","row":29624,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「お互い食事には苦労しているようだな」","en":"“Looks like we're all struggling to feed ourselves.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800445","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00044","en":"Taichi: \"Seems we are all having our problems with our diets.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000143b:text","row":29625,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええ……」","en":"“Yeah...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800446","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00045","en":"Miki: \"Yes...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001467:text","row":29626,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「霧ちん結婚しよう」","en":"“Kiri-kins, marry me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800447","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00046","en":"Taichi: \"Kiri-chin, let's get married!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001517:text","row":29627,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「不可能です」","en":"“Impossible.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800448","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00047","en":"Kiri: \"That is not possible.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000015c3:text","row":29628,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやです、じゃなくて不可能らしいですよ、先輩」","en":"“Notice she didn't say no, Taichi. Just ‘impossible.’”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800449","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00048","en":"Miki: \"Not a 'I do not want to', Senpai, it seems it's all the way to impossibility!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001613:text","row":29629,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「……燃えてきた」","en":"“...Now you've got me fired up.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800450","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00049","en":"Taichi: \"...I was burnt.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"The Japanese idiom means becoming fired up or enthusiastic; the English literalizes it as having been burned.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":23,"start":18,"text":"burnt"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001660:text","row":29630,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「水かけますよ？」","en":"“Want me to put you out?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800451","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00050","en":"Kiri: \"A cold water shower, then?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001692:text","row":29631,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「またか」","en":"“Again?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800452","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00051","en":"Taichi: \"Not another one, no.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000173a:text","row":29632,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「お菓子はもっとあるのですか？」","en":"“Do you have any more candy?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800453","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00052","en":"Miki: \"Are there any more sweets?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000017db:text","row":29633,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「あるよ。ビスケットとか、サブレとか。曜子先生はお菓子作るの得意だから」","en":"“Sure. Cookies, shortbread. Youko's great at baking.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800454","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00053","en":"Taichi: \"There are. Got biscuit, got sable'... all thanks to how skilled Youko-sensei is at making sweets.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000018c1:text","row":29634,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「へー、意外」","en":"“Huh. I wouldn't have guessed.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800455","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00054","en":"Miki: \"Ehhh, so unexpected.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000018ef:text","row":29635,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「いい保存食になるらしい」","en":"“Apparently they make good emergency rations.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800456","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00055","en":"Taichi: \"Seems she got good at making preserved food.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says sweets make useful preserved or emergency provisions; the English instead says a person became skilled at making preserved food.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":54,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Seems she got good at making preserved food.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000019a5:text","row":29636,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「……恋人、なんですよね？」","en":"“...You and Youko are a couple, aren't you?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800457","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00056","en":"Kiri: \"...are you two lovers?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000019e1:text","row":29637,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「え、俺と曜子ちゃんが？」","en":"“What, me and Youko?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800458","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00057","en":"Taichi: \"Eh, me and Youko-chan?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001a38:text","row":29638,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「それは美希も気になりすぎてました」","en":"“Miki's been dying to know too.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800459","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00058","en":"Miki: \"Miki was very interested about that too!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001afa:text","row":29639,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「食事も手につきません」","en":"“Miki can barely eat.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800460","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00059","en":"Miki: \"I cHan't even concHentrate on tShe eating!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001b32:text","row":29640,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ほっぺたパンパンじゃねぇか」","en":"“...Your cheeks are stuffed full.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800461","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00060","en":"Taichi: \"...ain't your cheeks all stuffed to the brim.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001bf2:text","row":29641,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「むぐ」","en":"“Mmf.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800462","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00061","en":"Miki: \"Mugu!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001c12:text","row":29642,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"真夏の食い溜め娘が。","en":"What's she doing, stocking up for winter in midsummer?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800463","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00062","en":"This girl's doing some Midsummer's Food Storing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001c46:text","row":29643,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、一緒に暮らしてただけだよ」","en":"“No. We just lived under the same roof.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800464","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00063","en":"Taichi: \"Nah, we've just lived together, nothing more.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001d5c:text","row":29644,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「同棲」","en":"“Shacking up.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800465","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00064","en":"Miki: \"Sharing the house.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["undertranslation","wordplay"],"assessment":"The Japanese uses a term for cohabiting as a couple; the generic phrase 'sharing the house' removes the relationship-specific premise of the exchange.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":0,"text":"Miki: \"Sharing the house.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001d9f:text","row":29645,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「同棲」","en":"“Shacking up.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800466","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00065","en":"Kiri: \"Sharing the house.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["undertranslation","wordplay"],"assessment":"The repeated Japanese term means romantic cohabitation; the generic English phrase again erases the running distinction.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":26,"start":0,"text":"Kiri: \"Sharing the house.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001dbf:text","row":29646,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"二人はハモった。","en":"They chorus.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800467","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00066","en":"The two harmonized.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001def:text","row":29647,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「違う。同棲とは違う」","en":"“No. We weren't shacking up.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800468","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00067","en":"Taichi: \"Wrong. Sharing the house is wrong.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation","wordplay"],"assessment":"The Japanese denies that the described arrangement counts as romantic cohabitation; the English instead declares house-sharing itself wrong.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: \"Wrong. Sharing the house is wrong.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001e25:text","row":29648,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええと、要するに俺たちは親がいないから、二人とも睦美さんに養ってもらってたんだよ。あ、これは俺の保護者ね」","en":"“Basically, neither of us had parents, so Mutsumi supported us both. She was my guardian, by the way.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800469","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00068","en":"Taichi: \"Uhm, in short, because we don't have parents, the two of us were being supported by Mutsumi-san. Ah, that's my guardian.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001eb1:text","row":29649,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"「姉弟みたいなものと言えばいえるけど……俺はそう思ってない」","en":"“You could say Youko was like an older sister to me... but that's not how I saw her.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800470","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00069","en":"Taichi: \"I could sort of say if I could that we're sort of like siblings, but... I don't really think that.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["undertranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese specifies an older-sister and younger-brother relationship; the generic English term loses that asymmetry.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":72,"start":64,"text":"siblings"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001f05:text","row":29650,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"向こうもそう思ってないし。","en":"And she didn't see me as a brother either.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800471","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00070","en":"My counterpart also doesn't think so.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001f37:text","row":29651,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"だから追い出されたし、曜子ちゃん。","en":"Which is why Youko got kicked out.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800472","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00071","en":"And that is why she was kicked out, that Youko-chan.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00001ff7:text","row":29652,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「へー、初耳」","en":"“Huh. That's news to me.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800473","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00072","en":"Miki: \"Ehhh, news to me!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000020a1:text","row":29653,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"「……あやしい関係だと思っていたのに……」","en":"“...And here I thought there was something going on between you...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800474","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00073","en":"Kiri: \"...and I was thinking it was a really suspicious relationship...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000020e3:text","row":29654,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"いや、実際あやしいです。","en":"No, she wasn't wrong to be suspicious.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800475","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00074","en":"Nah, it really is suspicious.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000211b:text","row":29655,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"「まー、そこはホレ。血縁ではないし」","en":"“Well, you know. We aren't related by blood.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800476","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00075","en":"Taichi: \"Ahhh, 'that' you mean. We're not blood related.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000021dd:text","row":29656,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「支倉先輩も謎が多い人ですよね」","en":"“Hasekura’s pretty mysterious too, isn’t she?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800477","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00076","en":"Miki: \"Hasekura-senpai is a woman of many mysteries, she is.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000221d:text","row":29657,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"「まったくだ」","en":"“She certainly is.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800478","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00077","en":"Taichi: \"Damn if she ain't.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000224b:text","row":29658,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"「さあ、特別に千歳あめをつけるから、みんなで七五三気分に浸ろう」","en":"“Here, I’ll even throw in some long-life candy sticks. We can all feel like kids at the Seven-Five-Three Festival.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800479","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00078","en":"Taichi: \"Well then, here's some special Thousand-Year Candy, so we can sink into that Shichi-Go-San ambiance!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002329:text","row":29659,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"「わー、ちとせあめだ！」","en":"“Ooh, chitose candy!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800480","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00079","en":"Miki: \"Weeee, Thousand-Year Candy!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000023ba:text","row":29660,"ordinal":80,"kind":"text","jp":"霧が取り上げる。","en":"Kiri confiscates it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800481","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00080","en":"Kiri confiscates it.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002468:text","row":29661,"ordinal":81,"kind":"text","jp":"「うおー、何するだ！」","en":"“Hey! Whaddaya think you're doing?!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800482","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00081","en":"Miki: \"Bwah, what are you doing!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000024b9:text","row":29662,"ordinal":82,"kind":"text","jp":"「お菓子だけじゃダメ」","en":"“You can't live on candy.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800483","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00082","en":"Kiri: \"Sweets only is no good.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000256d:text","row":29663,"ordinal":83,"kind":"text","jp":"「自分だって食べてたくせにー！」","en":"“You were eating it too!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800484","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00083","en":"Miki: \"But you ate them too dammiiit!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002629:text","row":29664,"ordinal":84,"kind":"text","jp":"「ちゃんとごはん食べる。健康管理、これからは自分でしないといけないんだよ？」","en":"“Eat real meals. You have to take care of yourself from now on, okay?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800485","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00084","en":"Kiri: \"Eat your meals properly. Health management is something we absolutely must do on our own from here on out, remember?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002713:text","row":29665,"ordinal":85,"kind":"text","jp":"「……へーい」","en":"“...Yeah, yeah.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800486","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00085","en":"Miki: \"...yeees.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002739:text","row":29666,"ordinal":86,"kind":"text","jp":"うーむ。","en":"Hmm.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800487","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00086","en":"Indeed.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:0000277c:text","row":29667,"ordinal":87,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんですか？　いやらしい目でじっと見て……」","en":"“What? Why are you ogling us like that?”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800488","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00087","en":"Kiri: \"What is it? You are staring at me with indecent eyes...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000027ca:text","row":29668,"ordinal":88,"kind":"text","jp":"「いやらしいって言うな」","en":"“Don't call it ogling.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800489","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00088","en":"Taichi: \"Don't call 'em indecent.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002802:text","row":29669,"ordinal":89,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、いいコンビだなって思って」","en":"“No, I was just thinking you make a good pair.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800490","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00089","en":"Taichi: \"Well, I was just thinking what a nice duo you make.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000028c2:text","row":29670,"ordinal":90,"kind":"text","jp":"「お花ちゃんたちですから」","en":"“We are the flower girls.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800491","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00090","en":"Miki: \"We are the Flowers after all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000028fc:text","row":29671,"ordinal":91,"kind":"text","jp":"「デビューさせてやりたいくらいだ」","en":"“I almost want to launch you as a duo.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800492","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00091","en":"Taichi: \"I wanna make you have your debut!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:000029bc:text","row":29672,"ordinal":92,"kind":"text","jp":"「今デビューしてもなぁ……」","en":"“Wouldn't be much point in debuting now...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800493","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00092","en":"Miki: \"But having our debut now, well...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002a74:text","row":29673,"ordinal":93,"kind":"text","jp":"「最高八枚までしか売れないね。ＣＤ」","en":"“We'd sell eight CDs, tops.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800494","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00093","en":"Kiri: \"We could sell no more than eight of those CDs.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002b36:text","row":29674,"ordinal":94,"kind":"text","jp":"「ミリオンは夢のまた夢」","en":"“A million is beyond our wildest dreams.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800495","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00094","en":"Miki: \"The million would be a dream within a dream.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography"],"assessment":"The English dialogue opens a quotation but does not close it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":52,"start":0,"text":"Miki: \"The million would be a dream within a dream.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002b89:text","row":29675,"ordinal":95,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃあわたし、二枚買ってあげる」","en":"“Then I’ll buy two copies.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800496","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00095","en":"Kiri: \"Well then, I'll be buying two copies.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002c49:text","row":29676,"ordinal":96,"kind":"text","jp":"「じゃこっちも二枚買う」","en":"“Then I'll buy two, too.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800497","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00096","en":"Miki: \"Then I'll buy two too!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002c9c:text","row":29677,"ordinal":97,"kind":"text","jp":"「十枚だね」","en":"“That makes ten.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800498","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00097","en":"Kiri: \"Ten copies then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002ce5:text","row":29678,"ordinal":98,"kind":"text","jp":"「うん、十枚。二桁」","en":"“Yep, ten. Double digits.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800499","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00098","en":"Miki: \"Yep, ten. Double digits.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002d11:text","row":29679,"ordinal":99,"kind":"text","jp":"くすくす笑う。","en":"They giggle.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800500","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00099","en":"Giggling laughter.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002d37:text","row":29680,"ordinal":100,"kind":"text","jp":"ほんと、仲睦まじい。","en":"They really are close.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800501","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00100","en":"Intimate harmony, truly.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0206:00002d63:text","row":29681,"ordinal":101,"kind":"text","jp":"その様子は、俺をほんの少しばかり、潤した。","en":"The sight puts a little life back into me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:800502","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0031b:00101","en":"And that was something that enriched me just a tiny little bit.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["presentation"]}]}]}
